  "notable_quotes": [
    "Topological description is useful not only for understanding coordination-polymer nets but also for designing targeted net structures.",
    "Pyridyl ligands have simple coordination modes, but weak coordination and charge neutrality hinder control of framework composition and metal/ligand ratios.",
    "The pillared-layer approach links 2D layers with ditopic pillars into 3D frameworks, and dense layers can avoid interpenetration even with long pillars."
